1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Welcome to The Baseline Society! In this video, we'll walk you through how to register for your tournament in under 2 minutes.

2
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Step 1: Select your events. Choose Men's Singles and Open Doubles. Real-time slot availability and entry fees calculate automatically.

3
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Step 2: Enter your player profile: Full Name, Age, Mobile Number, and Email Address to receive your match notifications.

4
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Step 3: If entering doubles, provide your partner's name and contact number to automatically link your team in the official draw.

5
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Step 4: Choose your payment method. Scan the UPI QR code and enter your 12-digit UTR, or select Pay in Cash at the tournament desk.

6
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Step 5: Click Complete Registration. Your entry is officially confirmed! See you on the court at The Baseline Society.
